WEBVTT

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:05.490
<i>Before we begin the conclusion.
Before we reach the conclusion.</i>

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:08.040
<i>There's another story
that needs to be disclosed.</i>

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:10.290
<i>One story remains.</i>

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:13.670
<i>You readers surely
haven't forgotten about it.</i>

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:19.050
<i>I'll admit, I wish
you had forgotten all about it,</i>

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:21.930
<i>and even more than that,
I wish I'd forgetten about it myself.</i>

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:23.590
KEEPING THAT UNDISCLOSED,
SECRETLY AND SORROWFULLY,
PRETENDING IT NEVER HAPPENED,
I WOULD'VE LIKED TO END THE STORY ABOUT ME

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:27.510
You surely won't get off that easily,
