00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:32.270
Please don't be so thoughtless as to try
and hide something while you're in front of me.

00:00:32.270 --> 00:00:34.400
I'm the nemesis of lies and screw-ups.

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:37.150
I'm a predator of procrastination
and postponement.

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:42.860
You're aware of the ending of Deishu Kaiki,
the distinguished con artist, correct?

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:46.160
If you don't want to end up like that,
please tell your story.

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:51.160
What you've obstinately hidden at all costs
until now... the story of that one time.

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:53.290
<i>Seeing such behavior,</i>

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:57.880
<i>it seems as if she already knows
all about those past incidents,</i>

00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:00.670
<i>but even if I about her about it,
I'm sure she'll feign ignorance.</i>

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:05.590
I don't know anything.
It's what you know, Araragi-senpai.

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:06.970
<i>Exactly.</i>

00:01:06.970 --> 00:01:09.970
<i>I know. I know extremely well.</i>

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:11.220
<i>Because I know, I wanted to hide it.</i>

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:12.980
REFERENCE BOOK

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:15.770
<i>But since I know, I must tell the tale.</i>

00:01:15.770 --> 00:01:18.520
<i>"It's going to be a long story," I say.</i>

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:20.280
I don't mind at all.

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:25.490
<i>It happened over two months
before Ougi Oshino transferred to our school.</i>

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:28.530
<i>After summer break was over,
and right after second term started.</i>

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:32.080
<i>My pairing with the vampire was severed,
and for the first time in six months</i>

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:35.040
<i>Koyomi Araragi had experienced
being almost fully mortal and "human."</i>

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:37.380
<i>He hadn't gone to school or gone home,</i>

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:40.210
<i>and in a classroom
in the cram school ruins</i>

00:01:40.210 --> 00:01:43.970
<i>that were the abode of the specialist Meme Oshino
