00:02:58.040 --> 00:02:59.210
OWARIMONOGATARI

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:02.040
SHINOBU MAIL, PART ONE

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:06.920
Araragi-senpai, it's been a while (o-hisa)!

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:10.180
IT'S A KNEE (O-HIZA)!

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:22.690
<i>Having screamed,
I wish it sounded more stylish.</i>

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:26.940
<i>It was too unfashionable to scream
like a frog that was just run over by a car.</i>

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:31.160
Well, having eaten a knee
from an underclassman right as we meet,

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:34.120
