to look stylish or anything.

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:37.160
Oh, nothing less from
our top-class Araragi-senpai.

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:40.170
To make a correlation between a kneecap (hiza-gashira)
and "right as we meet" (deai-gashira)...

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:41.880
You've really taken a point off of me.

00:03:42.210 --> 00:03:45.960
Of course, Araragi-senpai,
if I can trouble you to say so,

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:51.010
I prefer to call the kneecaps
my "knee-boys" (hiza-kozou).

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:54.390
When I think about having
two gorgeous boys living on my knees,

00:03:54.390 --> 00:03:56.680
