00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:08.030
When you think about how everyone
has festival pages living on their knees,

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:10.320
doesn't the world look
the slightest bit more fruitful?

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:13.240
Don't use the word "fruitful" like that either.

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:15.450
There are no festival pages on my knees.

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:21.290
More like, the biggest joke here
is that you kneed an upperclassman,

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:23.460
and you've yet to say
even one word of apology.

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:25.630
Apology?

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:28.340
What are you talking about?

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:31.090
I, Suruga Kanbaru,
am a faithful underclassman,

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:34.680
and am basically a part of your body
by now, Araragi-senpai.

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:39.560
Just because your knee landed on your cheek,
