00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:42.100
Very articulate, but what horrible logic!

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:45.650
Honestly, Araragi-senpai,
your recovery speed is so high,

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:50.150
there's a part of me that thinks I don't really need
