00:06:15.740 --> 00:06:16.820
Of course not!

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:18.280
TONIGHT, 9:00 O'CLOCK
SECOND FLOOR, ALONE
COME TO THE CLASSROOM
THERE'S SOMETHING I WANT TO ASK YOU

00:06:18.490 --> 00:06:20.870
