00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:11.790
TONIGHT, 9:00 O'CLOCK
SECOND FLOOR, ALONE
COME TO THE CLASSROOM
THERE'S SOMETHING I WANT TO ASK YOU

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:15.590
You said you had something
