00:07:27.850 --> 00:07:31.310
There will never be a time
that I'd ask you such a question.

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:33.980
My questions is...

00:07:33.980 --> 00:07:39.320
Namely, I'd like you to assist me with something,
so will you help out or not?

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:45.160
To be honest, I personally want you
to decline this offer.

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:47.040
There's no way I'd decline!

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:50.040
I, Suruga Kanbaru,
would never be in a situation

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:52.710
where I don't respond to a call
from you, Araragi-senpai!

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:55.300
Even if the heavens
and the earth flipped!

00:07:56.050 --> 00:08:00.090
Yeah, well...
It's not exactly my request.

00:08:00.090 --> 00:08:02.050
