00:08:06.470 --> 00:08:07.640
You don't know?

00:08:07.640 --> 00:08:09.430
Yeah. I don't know any of it.

00:08:09.430 --> 00:08:10.690
IT WAS PROBABLY INTENTIONALLY
NOT DISCLOSED TO ME.

00:08:10.890 --> 00:08:13.900
So, if you were to decline right now,

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:17.400
