00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:51.180
Yeah... Well, you have a point.

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:54.850
I can't help but feel
I want to be of service to you, Araragi-senpai.

00:08:55.610 --> 00:08:57.940
I had a book
I wanted to read tonight, too.

00:08:57.940 --> 00:09:01.490
