00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:32.480
Lies!

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:35.980
The great Shugoro Yamamoto
would never write a book with a title like that!

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:39.900
No, but it actually exists,
so there's nothing you can do...

00:09:39.900 --> 00:09:43.110
Though, actually, it's out of stock
and the next printing date is unknown.

00:09:44.360 --> 00:09:45.240
RETURNING TO OUR SUBJECT

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:47.990
Now, Kanbaru, what I wanted to ask you...

00:09:48.240 --> 00:09:51.790
Then, sorry to rush you,
but can you come with me for a sec?

00:09:52.370 --> 00:09:55.460
