Because there's someone I'd like you to meet.

00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:31.660
My oh my, you really are a troublesome person.

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:34.000
Who did you decide to show off to,
and how did you do it?

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.790
