00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:44.170
I was asked by someone
to introduce you, so...

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:49.300
Oh, well. If it's something you say, Araragi-senpai,
there's no mistake about it.

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:53.180
If possible, I'd like you
to cut your trust in me by like half...

00:10:54.100 --> 00:10:55.310
But, it's all right.

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:58.730
At the least, it won't be a boy or a girl
confessing their love to you.

00:10:58.730 --> 00:11:01.310
It's not an introduction
or mediation of that sort.

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:04.070
I wouldn't mind if it was
that sort either, you know?

00:11:04.070 --> 00:11:05.190
I'd flat out reject them.

00:11:06.400 --> 00:11:11.530
Of course, it'd be different if the punch line was like,
"the one I wanted to introduce to you... Is me!"

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:15.660
Don't take every chance to try dating me.
Just how sexually aggressive are you?

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:19.670
No, I'm not trying to date you.
All I want is a physical relationship.

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:22.210
Since I'm sexually aggressive,
