as you live your life?

00:11:33.390 --> 00:11:37.730
If it looks like I'm thinking about something,
you probably should take me to the hospital.

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:39.600
And returning to our subject...

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:40.350
RETURNING TO OUR SUBJECT

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:44.150
Okeydokey, Araragi-senpai,
I understand the details.

00:11:44.150 --> 00:11:45.820
