00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:51.700
<i>You really are amazing...</i>

00:11:51.910 --> 00:11:52.620
Departing!

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:53.240
DEPARTING.

00:12:01.420 --> 00:12:03.920
