00:13:35.220 --> 00:13:40.640
Well, I thought this was a full suit of armor.
But upon close inspection, it's lacking...

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:41.810
Lacking?

00:13:41.810 --> 00:13:46.190
Yeah. See, there are five or six
suits of armor at my house...

00:13:46.190 --> 00:13:50.070
But compared to those,
that armor-clad samurai is lacking something crucial.

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:55.910
But as far as I can see,
