00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:04.960
You want me to?

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:08.880
I mean, I don't know how
to put a suit of armor together.

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:12.710
Then, I'll give you instructions,
so how about you put it together?

00:14:12.710 --> 00:14:16.300
You really don't hesitate to use
your upperclassmen as tools, do you?

00:14:16.590 --> 00:14:17.590
Though, it's fine.

00:14:18.260 --> 00:14:23.270
I'll show you that I'm not merely a man
