00:14:23.430 --> 00:14:26.350
I'll show you that I can lie on my back,
not just on my stomach.

00:14:26.520 --> 00:14:30.360
An upperclassman I respect lying on his back
is definitely something I don't want to see...

00:14:30.730 --> 00:14:33.530
But, why is there a need to reassemble it?

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:37.990
I mean, if we reassemble it,
there's the chance it might start moving again...

00:14:59.090 --> 00:15:01.140
<i>What is lacking from this suit of armor.</i>

00:15:01.810 --> 00:15:02.760
<i>That is...</i>

00:15:07.770 --> 00:15:09.600
Stand back, Araragi-senpai!

00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:11.110
FIST PUNCH TOUCH BODY HIT ABDOMEN
PUSH LEFT STRIKE HAND PATCH POWER
ENERGY DRAIN TOUCH LEFT MONKEY RAIN PAIN

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:20.120
PUNCH JAW FIST ENERGY DRAIN HIT TOUCH
MONKEY NECK FLY THROAT HIT PAIN

00:15:39.260 --> 00:15:40.010
Kanbaru?

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:41.850
S-Stay away!

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:51.060
<i>No, but this thing, somehow...</i>

00:15:54.270 --> 00:15:56.320
<i>...looks like he's getting
tougher and tougher?</i>

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:01.200
A-Araragi-senpai...

00:16:02.740 --> 00:16:03.740
Run!

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:06.700
THAT WAS THE ONE ORDER I COULD NOT OBEY.

00:16:09.370 --> 00:16:11.460
<i>An armor-clad samurai
that was getting tougher and tougher,</i>

00:16:11.830 --> 00:16:14.670
<i>and in contrast,
Kanbaru was getting weaker and weaker.</i>

00:16:14.670 --> 00:16:16.590
<i>I hadn't noticed that.</i>

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:18.970
<i>She first landed a blow to the body.</i>

00:16:19.550 --> 00:16:20.880
<i>Then, another blow...</i>

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:24.430
<i>And around when she punched its throat,
she was already down on one knee.</i>

00:16:25.350 --> 00:16:28.770
<i>I was wondering why
she was down on her knee at that point...</i>

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:34.230
<i>But seeing how she collapsed
after she tackled and grabbed onto it, I was convinced.</i>

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:37.530
<i>An energy drain.</i>

00:16:37.530 --> 00:16:38.530
ENERGY DRAIN

00:16:38.820 --> 00:16:39.530
<i>Why?</i>

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:43.700
<i>Why does an old-fashioned,
out of place, armor-clad samurai</i>

00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:47.660
<i>use an energy drain
as if it was a vampire?</i>

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:51.710
<i>What in the world is this guy?</i>

00:17:20.990 --> 00:17:21.990
W-Wha—

00:17:24.110 --> 00:17:27.910
W-What are you? What do you mean by this?

00:17:27.910 --> 00:17:30.250
What do you have against us?

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:32.870
Why are you doing such a thing?

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:46.760
DON'T COME OVER HERE.

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:47.680
IF YOU CAN MOVE,
HURRY UP AND MAKE A RUN FOR IT.

00:17:49.140 --> 00:17:50.890
RUN FOR IT.

00:17:50.890 --> 00:17:52.640
I WON'T RUN AWAY.

00:17:58.570 --> 00:17:59.320
I'LL GO BEHIND

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:01.110
AND POKE ITS KNEES FROM BEHIND

00:18:01.900 --> 00:18:02.650
SO TAKE THAT CHANCE

00:18:03.400 --> 00:18:04.280
AND YOU SHOULD MAKE A RUN FOR IT.

00:18:04.780 --> 00:18:07.160
<i>Why are you so stupid,
even in eye contact?</i>

00:18:30.720 --> 00:18:32.020
Hanekawa-senpai.

00:18:37.650 --> 00:18:39.610
It seems my time to retreat is now...

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:44.740
Looks like an something far from mediocre
is interfering.

00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:47.070
Did someone step on a tiger's tail?

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:51.950
As I am now,
I can't quite deal with all of it!

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:54.910
It seems my timing for this was off.

00:18:55.370 --> 00:18:59.670
It seems my master is not here, either...
So I shall come by another time!

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:03.800
You shouldn't make any detours
and go straight home as well!

00:19:09.220 --> 00:19:14.810
<i>That armor-clad samurai,
by firmly grabbing my neck, sucked away my voice.</i>

00:19:15.430 --> 00:19:16.690
<i>An energy drain.</i>

00:19:17.310 --> 00:19:19.690
<i>Just like how he recreated Kanbaru's tackle,</i>

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:22.690
<i>he now recreated my voice.</i>

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:27.360
Once you're reunited with Kiss-shot,
tell this to her!

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:29.740
Once I have recovered a bit more,

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:34.950
I'll come see her to regain
my cherished demon sword "Kokoro Watari"!

00:19:35.580 --> 00:19:39.960
After all, without a blade,
an armor-clad samurai feels incomplete!

00:19:40.210 --> 00:19:43.090
In the end, it's been 400 years
since I lent it to her.

00:19:43.090 --> 00:19:46.970
Tell her that she should prepare herself
for the late fees!

00:20:04.480 --> 00:20:08.190
Araragi-senpai, what was that?
That armor-clad samurai...

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:11.740
I thought it was strange that a suit of armor
wasn't wielding a blade.

00:20:11.990 --> 00:20:16.620
But he mentioned the demon sword "Kokoro Watari,"
which was... And he also said Kiss-shot...

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:20.120
For now, we'll deal with that later...

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:34.390
Kanbaru... You must be able to reach
the ceiling somehow with one or two steps,

00:20:34.390 --> 00:20:37.430
even without a running start?

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:39.390
You can jump up, can't you?

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:43.860
And, from the third floor,
use the elevator shafts to get to the first floor...

00:20:43.860 --> 00:20:48.610
That's overestimating your underclassman
way too much, Araragi-senpai.

00:20:48.610 --> 00:20:50.900
My legs aren't that strong.

00:20:51.490 --> 00:20:57.450
Even I don't have enough jumping strength
to grab onto an older boy and jump up to the ceiling.

00:20:58.120 --> 00:20:59.040
I see...

00:21:00.710 --> 00:21:01.670
Araragi-senpai...

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:03.460
What is it, Kanbaru?

00:21:03.460 --> 00:21:05.790
Will you be my first?

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:07.090
Don't brace yourself like that!

00:21:07.090 --> 00:21:08.880
I don't want to die a virgin.

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:10.420
Don't be coming out to me!

00:21:10.420 --> 00:21:11.170
YOU ALWAYS SAY STUFF LIKE THAT.

00:21:11.170 --> 00:21:11.930
THAT'S WHY THE STORY WHERE
YOU WERE THE MAIN CHARACTER WAS GLOSSED OVER.

00:21:14.590 --> 00:21:18.310
Oh, well. This isn't a bad way to die either.

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:21.180
If I can die together with Araragi-senpai,
I couldn't wish for more.

00:21:21.390 --> 00:21:26.060
No, I'm sorry Kanbaru,
but I can't think of you that dearly.

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:27.690
That hurts my feelings.

00:21:29.030 --> 00:21:32.200
<i>The partner I'd want to die together with...
There's only one.</i>

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:36.320
<i>The one and only existence
is that blonde apparition.</i>

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:39.580
<i>She's currently not here.</i>

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:45.420
<i>That's why... We must survive
and escape from this flaming building.</i>

00:21:46.380 --> 00:21:49.340
I have no choice...
Guess I have to brace myself for this.

00:21:50.420 --> 00:21:52.720
You mean brace yourself to be my first?

00:21:52.720 --> 00:21:55.430
I can't brace myself to make
such a monumental decision.

00:21:55.430 --> 00:21:58.260
We have to take our chances
and jump from the window.

00:21:58.260 --> 00:22:00.310
That should be better
than burning to death right here.

00:22:00.310 --> 00:22:03.980
You're right. I was thinking
that was the only thing left for us as well.

00:22:03.980 --> 00:22:04.980
YOU'RE LYING.

00:22:06.060 --> 00:22:07.310
YOU WERE THINKING ABOUT SOMETHING
COMPLETELY DIFFERENT.

00:22:08.820 --> 00:22:10.070
DON'T MAKE A MISTAKE, ARARAGI-SENPAI.
YOU START FROM THE RIGHT FOOT.

00:22:11.570 --> 00:22:12.820
BUT SINCE I'M LEFT-HANDED,
SOMETIMES I MAKE A MISTAKE BETWEEN RIGHT AND LEFT.

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:27.630
They call something like this
"extinguishing a fire with dynamite."

00:22:29.290 --> 00:22:31.630
Don't think you can die in a place like this.

00:22:31.920 --> 00:24:20.280
Yours truly is the one that will kill you,
devilish Big Brother.
